  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "📦 VDocs – Release Notes – HTML Table Border Rendering Improvements\n🚀 Version: 2026.5.1\n\n🔧 What’s Improved?\n - More accurate mapping of Word table borders to HTML/CSS\n - Improved rendering consistency for:\n  - Top, bottom, left, and right borders\n  - Inside horizontal borders\n  - Inside vertical borders\n - Better preservation of border styles, sizes, and colors during HTML export\n - Improved compatibility with browser-based rendering engines\n\n📈 Result\n- Tables exported to HTML now produce:\n  - Cleaner visual output\n  - More accurate border styling\n  - Better fidelity compared to the original Word document\n  - Improved consistency across modern browsers\n  \n🛠 Stability\n  - No breaking API changes\n  - Existing HTML export workflows remain compatible\n  - Recommended update for users exporting tables to HTML",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "VDocs - Word Document Framework",
